# FCP padel domain (this project)

Padel Cantabria re-presents **public** Federación Cántabra de Pádel data for UX. Not affiliated with the FCP. Do **not** invent results or season-specific rules — use the DB / scrapers, and point to official PDFs when precision matters:

[Documentos y Normativas](https://federacioncantabradepadel.com/Documentos-Normativas)

---

## How this repo models a league fixture

Federation site → our tables:

| Federation idea | Code / UI |
| --- | --- |
| Club vs club jornada | `matches` (team fixture: `home_team_id` / `away_team_id`) |
| Scheduled pair slots / courts (*tandas*) | `matches.rounds` — UI: `Tandas: …` (`formatMatchMeta`) |
| Result header (aggregate) | `match_results`: `home_matches` / `away_matches`, `home_sets` / `away_sets`, `home_games` / `away_games`, `rounds_order` (*Orden de las tandas*) |
| One pair vs pair contest inside the fixture | `match_games` (`game_number`, four player names, sets, `partials`) |
| Classification | `team_standings` (wins, sets for/against, etc.) |

**Hierarchy:** category → **match** (teams) → **match_result** (team scoreline) → **match_games** (each pair court).

Winner summary prefers sets, then games: `summarizeMatchResult` in `@padel-cantabria/shared`.

English in code/logs; **Spanish only in user-visible UI** (`Tandas`, W.O., etc.).

